==Trivia==
[[Miki Tanaka]] illustrated both a {{TCG ID|Vending|Sandshrew|S2}} card and a {{TCG ID|Skyridge|Sandslash|93}} card for the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]; though the cards did not originally release together in the TCG, their illustrations were later included alongside each other in Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Skyridge|Sandslash|93}} from the {{TCG|Skyridge}} expansion.
*{{m|Slash}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Sandslash}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

